@startuml sd-release
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
mainframe sd Release Freezing E

actor "사용자" as User
participant ":FreezingTools" as T
participant ":FreezingManager" as M
participant "region : FreezingRegion" as R

User -> T : 목록에서 영역 선택
User -> T : 선택한 Freezing 해제 클릭
T -> M : release(region)
M -> M : regions.remove(region)
M -> R : release()
R -> R : changeState(NormalState.INSTANCE)
M -> T : refresh()
T -> T : message("Freezing을 해제했습니다...")

note over M, R
  모든 Freezing 해제는 releaseAll(),
  Grid > Clear와 Load는 reset()이
  영역마다 같은 release()를 부른다
end note
@enduml
